<title>GERMANY: VW finance unit to offer 20 bln yen bond.</title>
<headline>VW finance unit to offer 20 bln yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The financial services unit of German carmaker Volkswagen AG said on Wednesday it would offer a nominal 20 billion yen Samurai bond at the end of March through its Dutch subsidiary.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
